{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"valid\": true,\n  \"entry\": \"左上方第一块白色加粗大字首先进入视线，“他仍不服气”最容易被抓到；随后下方第二块同样醒目的白色大字争夺注意力。\",\n  \"grasp_who\": \"只抓到他仍对过去的事情不服气，具体处境不够明确。\",\n  \"grasp_feel\": \"不服气；难受的情绪隐约可见，但不够确定。\",\n  \"missed\": \"他不敢多想过去开心的事；与自己争斗到筋疲力尽后，不服气逐渐淡去，意识到自己已经不在那些人身边，因此感到难受。\",\n  \"burden\": [\n    \"两块白色加粗大字字号和亮度接近，争夺主视线。\",\n    \"单块主句较长，一块里包含好几层意思。\",\n    \"核心意思分散在上下两块主句里，需要结合才能理解情绪变化和处境之间的关系。\",\n    \"每块主句下方还有一组较小的短语，需要在多条之间挑选信息。\"\n  ],\n  \"score\": 2\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "29948688-ecfb-48a7-a52c-c06a4d6ba62d", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261110T031531932126Z", "elapsed_seconds": 19.5, "completed_utc": "2026-11-10T03:15:51.445423+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "fa9cfc0131c37220eeb047a263b15041ba918f2f7526a847285bade54efb8c46", "attachment_count": 1}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 1, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683"